<h2>The architecture of appellate power</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Provision</th><th>Power</th><th>Trigger</th></tr>
  <tr><td>O.41 R.24</td><td>Decide the case finally on the existing record</td><td>Evidence on record sufficient — the default</td></tr>
